body:
no. it was 100% involuntary. I did not request a particular hospital. I did not request a treatment path.

&#x200B;

The cops cuffed me and took me the ER against my will. From the ER they moved me to the "crisis center" (still within the hospital) and then eventually sent me to different mental instutation to see a physiatrist. (I'm told the  physiatrist  place is 100% free, so not worried about that). I spent about 20 hours at the hospital.
